description: Do not add a Cursor co-author trailer to git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits

Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any other Cursor co-author trailer to commit messages. Do not pass `--trailer` for a Cursor co-author. Do not add `Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)` to a commit message or a pull request. The commit author is the user only.
